WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.769
Welcome to Konnektora.

00:00:01.769 --> 00:00:04.906
Discovery begins with shared interests.

00:00:04.906 --> 00:00:10.777
Explore events, places and topics to find communities that
matter to you.

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:19.142
Review a gathering's details and attendance conditions and
connect with people who share your interests.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:25.013
This guide introduces discovery, profiles, community, events
and privacy.

00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:30.000
Start with the Events, Places and Tags links on the home page.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.232
Tags are shared meeting points for interests.

00:00:34.232 --> 00:00:39.875
Search for a topic, open its page and explore related posts.

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:45.705
Adding interests to your profile helps it reflect who you are.

00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:51.442
Discover events and members around the topics you care about.

00:00:51.442 --> 00:01:00.000
You do not need to follow only popular topics; start with the
interests that matter to you.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.309
Your profile is your personal space in the community.

00:01:04.309 --> 00:01:09.675
Edit your username, photo and the information you choose to
share.

00:01:09.675 --> 00:01:14.553
Interests help other members understand what matters to you.

00:01:14.553 --> 00:01:20.407
Do not create an account as someone else and protect your
login details.

00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:24.065
Save changes to account and profile settings.

00:01:24.065 --> 00:01:30.000
Google and Facebook sign-in availability depends on provider
permissions.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.464
Review an event's detail page before making plans.

00:01:34.464 --> 00:01:39.732
Date, time zone, location and attendance conditions matter.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:46.429
Some events are public; others require organiser approval or
an invitation.

00:01:46.429 --> 00:01:52.679
Place pages help you discover the community and events around
a venue.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:55.714
Sharing your location is optional.

00:01:55.714 --> 00:02:00.000
Use location controls to explore nearby options.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.216
A topic can be the start of a conversation.

00:02:04.216 --> 00:02:12.255
Read tag, event and place posts and contribute your
experiences where appropriate.

00:02:12.255 --> 00:02:18.725
Respect other members' privacy and community rules when
messaging.

00:02:18.725 --> 00:02:24.118
Use reporting tools if you find a problem with content.

00:02:24.118 --> 00:02:30.000
If you need help, browse the Help Centre or contact support.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.562
Manage visibility and notification preferences in Settings.

00:02:34.562 --> 00:02:39.665
Choose what to share and avoid posting sensitive details
publicly.

00:02:39.665 --> 00:02:43.222
Privacy and Terms explain the service further.

00:02:43.222 --> 00:02:51.108
Freezing an account does not delete all its data; use the
separate deletion instructions for requests.

00:02:51.108 --> 00:02:53.814
Konnektora is in a controlled beta.

00:02:53.814 --> 00:03:00.000
Start by choosing an interest and discovering an experience
that matters to you.
